    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, quick question. im taking haloperidol for my meds but i have a really bad sinus infection/congestion right now and i cant breathe through my nose at all. is it okay if i take some sudafed (pseudoephedrine) to help clear it up? just want to feel a bit more normal today.",
